Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.47,0:04:48.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And he has your number?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.47,0:04:48.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他有你的电话号码吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.35,0:04:51.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, I'll see that he gets the message. Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.35,0:04:51.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，我一定会转达留言，再见
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.98,0:04:55.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What? Ross says hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.98,0:04:55.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 什么  - 罗斯打来打招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.73,0:04:57.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.73,0:04:57.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.19,0:04:59.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is so fun. All right, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.19,0:04:59.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好好玩哦 好，现在我们要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.03,0:05:03.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, now I actually have to get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.03,0:05:03.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯，现在我真的要开始工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:04.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Most likely."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:04.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝很有可能〞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.83,0:05:11.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Okay, I'm gonna be out there. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.83,0:05:11.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好，我就在外面 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.29,0:05:15.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- All right. Bye-bye. - Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.29,0:05:15.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好啦，再见 - 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.67,0:05:21.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.67,0:05:21.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.88,0:05:23.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.88,0:05:23.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.60,0:05:30.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, windows are clean, candles are lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.60,0:05:30.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，窗户很干净，蜡烛都点了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.31,0:05:32.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, belt's too tight. Gotta change the belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.31,0:05:32.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}皮带太紧 要换皮带
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:35.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did I turn the fish? Nope, because I made lasagna.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:35.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}鱼翻面了吗  没有 因为我做的是千层面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:41.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Am I out of control? - Just a touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:41.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我是不是完全失控了  - 一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.28,0:05:42.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mon, I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.28,0:05:42.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡，我不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.57,0:05:46.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, you've been dating this guy since, like, his midterms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.57,0:05:46.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟这个男的从… 期中考吧，就开始约会了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.66,0:05:50.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, why all of a sudden are you so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.66,0:05:50.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么突然…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:54.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:54.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.46,0:05:56.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.46,0:05:56.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.29,0:05:59.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Could tonight be the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.29,0:05:59.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是不是就在今夜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.67,0:06:01.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.67,0:06:01.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.01,0:06:07.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, he's a great guy, and I love being with him, but, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.01,0:06:07.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是个很好的人 我喜欢跟他在一起，但是你也知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.51,0:06:09.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...things happen when they happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.51,0:06:09.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事情该发生的时候就会发生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.26,0:06:10.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't plan these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.26,0:06:10.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}计划不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.89,0:06:15.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh. So did you shave your legs? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.89,0:06:15.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你刮过腿毛了吗  - 刮过了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.65,0:06:16.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.65,0:06:16.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}呃-哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.61,0:06:22.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you let it go, Ross? It was just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.61,0:06:22.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能不能不要再钻牛角尖了，罗斯  那只是一个梦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.86,0:06:23.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It doesn't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.86,0:06:23.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不表示…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.32,0:06:28.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, oh, oh. Oh, this is it. Oh, my God. It's baby time. Baby time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.32,0:06:28.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来了！天啊 要生了，要生宝宝了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.03,0:06:32.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, relax, relax, just relax, just relax. Be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.03,0:06:32.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别紧张，别紧张，不要紧张 轻松一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.66,0:06:35.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, hi, I was just beeped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.66,0:06:35.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂，哔哔扣刚刚响
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.29,0:06:42.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, Andre is not here. Third time today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.29,0:06:42.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里没有安德烈 今天已经第三次了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.21,0:06:44.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I am sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.21,0:06:44.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，我很确定
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.47,0:06:48.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Heh. No, sir, I do not perform those kind of services.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.47,0:06:48.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，先生，我不提供那样的服务
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.64,0:06:52.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Services? Oh, services.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.64,0:06:52.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}服务 哦 服务
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.39,0:06:55.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, you want 55-JUMBO.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.39,0:06:55.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，您要打的是 55-JUMBO
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.69,0:06:59.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.69,0:06:59.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.36,0:07:00.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.36,0:07:00.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.07,0:07:04.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's right. "JUMBO" with a U, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.07,0:07:04.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错，先生 有〝U〞的那个〝JUMBO〞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.32,0:07:05.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Heh. No, you don't want me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.32,0:07:05.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}您要的不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.07,0:07:09.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Judging by his number, I'd be a huge disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.07,0:07:09.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以他的电话号码来判断 我会让您很失望
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:12.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Alrighty, bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:12.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，好的，再见
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.83,0:07:18.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}JOEY: Hey, hey. How was the first day? - Hey. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.83,0:07:18.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嘿，第一天上班的感觉怎样  - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.46,0:07:22.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excellent. Everyone was so, so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.46,0:07:22.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很棒，大家都对我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.17,0:07:24.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See? It pays to know the man who wears my shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.17,0:07:24.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看吧 认识一个 能穿我鞋子的人是有好处的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:27.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Me. - Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:27.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.93,0:07:31.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I didn't tell anybody that I knew you. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.93,0:07:31.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我没跟人说我本来就认识你  - 为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.60,0:07:33.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, because, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.60,0:07:33.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为，嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.31,0:07:36.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They don't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.31,0:07:36.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们不喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.94,0:07:41.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What? - I thought you knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.94,0:07:41.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 什么  - 你都不知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.94,0:07:43.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nah-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.94,0:07:43.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喏-呵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.65,0:07:47.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Who doesn't like me? - Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.65,0:07:47.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 谁不喜欢我？ - 大家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.99,0:07:49.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Except for, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.99,0:07:49.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.87,0:07:51.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.87,0:07:51.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，大家都不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.24,0:07:57.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What are you talking about? - Don't feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.24,0:07:57.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你在说什么？ - 不要难过
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.41,0:07:59.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, they used to like you a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.41,0:07:59.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们以前其实很喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.04,0:08:03.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But then you got promoted, and now you're all, like, Mr. Boss-Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.04,0:08:03.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是你升官了，现在你变成老板
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:06.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, Mr. Bing. Mr. Bing. Boss-Man Bing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:06.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们叫你宾先生 宾先生，宾老板
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.26,0:08:12.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I can't believe it. - Yeah, yeah. They even do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.26,0:08:12.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 真不敢相信 - 他们还模仿你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.35,0:08:16.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- They do me? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.35,0:08:16.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 模仿我  - 对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.43,0:08:18.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, like, um, okay:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.43,0:08:18.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.89,0:08:20.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Could that report be any later?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.89,0:08:20.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝那份报告可以再拖一点〞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.94,0:08:28.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't sound like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.94,0:08:28.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说话才不是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.32,0:08:31.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, oh. Chandler. - Oh. Yeah, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.32,0:08:31.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 钱德 - 就是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.57,0:08:34.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"The hills are alive with the sound...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.57,0:08:34.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝群山在乐声中充满了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.87,0:08:36.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of music."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.87,0:08:36.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}生气〞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.17,0:08:43.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"My scone!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.17,0:08:43.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝我的司康松糕！〞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.38,0:08:45.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS, JOEY & PHOEBE: "My scone!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.38,0:08:45.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝我的司康松糕！〞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.38,0:08:49.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I don't sound like that. That is so not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.38,0:08:49.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}少来，我说话不是那样子 那不是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.89,0:08:55.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That is so not... That is so not... That...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.89,0:08:55.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是…那不是…那…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.81,0:08:57.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.81,0:08:57.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.98,0:09:01.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ha, ha. You did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.98,0:09:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.77,0:09:03.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am telling you, up until I was 9...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.77,0:09:03.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的，一直到我9岁…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.90,0:09:06.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I thought gunpoint was an actual place where crimes happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.90,0:09:06.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我都认为枪下就是人犯罪的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.90,0:09:10.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Ha, ha. How is that possible? - Think about it. It's always on the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.90,0:09:10.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 怎么可能  - 你想想看，新闻不是一直在播
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.74,0:09:13.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"A man is being held up at Gunpoint."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.74,0:09:13.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝一名男子被架在枪下〞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.57,0:09:15.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Tourists are being terrorized at Gunpoint."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.57,0:09:15.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝观光客枪下惊魂〞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.16,0:09:19.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I just kept thinking, "Why do people continue to go there?"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.16,0:09:19.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一直很疑惑 〝为什么大家还是继续去那里〞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:25.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:25.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦，啊
